Mental health encompasses our emotional, psychological, and social well-being. It affects how we think, feel, and act, and it impacts our ability to enjoy life. Mental health problems can range from mild to severe, including conditions like depression, anxiety, bipolar disorder, schizophrenia, and more. These conditions can significantly impact daily functioning and quality of life.

